  "description": "APPLICATION PROCESS – PLEASE READ CAREFULLY All enquiries must be submitted through the Daft.ie advertisement. Applicants will then receive an online application form from Planet Verify containing a short questionnaire with some basic questions. No documents are required at this stage. Please ensure that the Planet Verify questionnaire is completed in full. Once the completed applications have been reviewed, applicants will be shortlisted and those selected will be invited to attend a viewing. Due to the expected level of interest, we may not be able to offer a viewing to every applicant. \n\nDF Properties are delighted to introduce this bright and spacious three-bedroom home at 38 Belvedere Lawn, Father Russell Road, to the rental market. Offered unfurnished and freshly painted throughout, the property is presented in excellent condition and is ready for immediate occupation. The accommodation is well laid out and comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable living room, a fitted kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom. To the rear is a private garden, providing lovely outdoor space. Belvedere Lawn is located in a popular and convenient residential area, close to local schools, shops, supermarkets and a wide range of everyday amenities. Raheen Business Park, University Hospital Limerick, Dooradoyle and Limerick City are all within easy reach, with excellent access to the surrounding road network. Rent: €2,400 per month. Disclaimer: These particulars are provided for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. While every effort has been made to ensure that the information provided is accurate, DF Properties accepts no responsibility for any errors, omissions or inaccuracies. Prospective tenants should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information, measurements and details provided.",
